  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><span>该模组是一款末日风格模组，包含种类丰富的近战武器。模组还添加了独特的建筑结构和战利品。此外，该模组还加入了自定义护甲。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>-在最新版本中，进入新生物群系需要穿着化学防护服。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>-为使该模组在 1.18.2 及更高版本上正常运行，需要安装\nGeckoLib： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files</a></span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
